  "purpose": {
    "classification": "DECLARED",
    "text": "RuntimePlan \u2014 the lowered, execution-ready shape the planner emits from a verified `GraphIr`. It carries the execution partitions, per-edge buffer sizing, fan-out/fan-in groupings, and stable metric handles the runtime (Wave 6) consumes. No node is executed here; this is the plan, not the run."
  },
